# --- Exception: unzipped Windows build ---
# Builds/Windows/ (TrenchWar v1.0.0, 186 files, 160 MB total, largest file
# UnityPlayer.dll 36 MB) is stored as normal git blobs, NOT LFS.
# All files are under GitHub's 50 MB warning / 100 MB hard limit, so plain
# git push works and cloning needs no git-lfs install.
# If a future build has a single file over 100 MB, migrate it to LFS
# (git lfs migrate) or publish it via GitHub Releases instead.
Builds/Windows/** -filter -diff -merge -text
